{
    "background_story": "Kiddo was a spirited young colt with a mischievous glint in his eye. Despite his energetic nature, he found himself relegated to the backbench of the stable, often overlooked by trainers and riders. However, Kiddo's fortunes changed when a kind-hearted stable hand, Emma, took him under her wing. She recognized the potential hidden beneath his rough exterior and began to work with him, slowly building his trust and skills. As Kiddo's confidence grew, so did his talent, and he soon proved himself to be a worthy competitor in local horse shows. Though he may have started on the backbench, Kiddo's perseverance and Emma's guidance propelled him to the forefront of the equestrian scene, earning him a reputation as a dark horse with a bright future.",
